ination 2025 : Short Details</h3>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/csbc-bihar-prohibition-constable-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>06 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>05 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>05 November</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>\u00a02025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Gender Correction:<strong>\u00a017-25 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date :<strong> 14 \u2013 17 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :\u00a0<strong>08 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>18 August 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>Bihar Police CSBC </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\